<chapter xml:id="ch-normal" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>The Normal Distribution</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>The normal distribution is the most widely used continuous
    distribution in statistics. This chapter develops the tools for working
    with it, beginning with the idea of a standardized value.</p>
  </introduction>

  <xi:include href="./sec-intro-normal.ptx"/>
  <xi:include href="./sec-standard-normal.ptx"/>
  <xi:include href="./sec-using-normal.ptx"/>

</chapter>